1
00:00:00,954 --> 00:00:05,324
(Raj:)one should only be...
washing the dishes.

2
00:00:06,359 --> 00:00:07,929
(Howard:)Just because you
have that accent

3
00:00:07,994 --> 00:00:10,894
(Howard:)doesn't mean what
you say isn't stupid.

4
00:00:10,964 --> 00:00:12,694
(Raj:)No, seriously.

5
00:00:12,766 --> 00:00:14,896
(Raj:)It's about being present
in the moment,

6
00:00:14,968 --> 00:00:18,038
(Raj:)focusing on the feeling
of the warm water,

7
00:00:18,104 --> 00:00:19,904
(Raj:)the smell of
the detergent,

8
00:00:19,973 --> 00:00:23,643
(Raj:)the sound of the dishes squeaking,
and following your own breath.

9
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:27,110
(Raj:)It's about... it's
about simply being.

10
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:29,010
Ah. (chuckles)

11
00:00:29,082 --> 00:00:31,382
(Howard:)Okay... I'll try it.

12
00:00:31,451 --> 00:00:33,851
(all inhale deeply)

13
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:36,920
(all exhale)

14
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:38,320
(Soup Kitchen Manager:)I need three people
out front.

15
00:00:38,391 --> 00:00:40,991
I'll do it!
Me! Right here!

16
00:00:41,061 --> 00:00:44,531
No fair! I was meditating!

17
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:47,800
(Leonard:)Come on,
don't be mad.

18
00:00:47,867 --> 00:00:49,707
(Leonard:)It was a long time ago,
and it was an accident.

19
00:00:49,769 --> 00:00:52,369
(Penny:)How can reading my journal
be an accident?

20
00:00:52,439 --> 00:00:53,509
(Leonard:)I didn't even
know what it was.

21
00:00:53,573 --> 00:00:55,713
(Leonard:)I saw it on your nightstand.
I picked it up.

22
00:00:55,775 --> 00:00:57,645
(Penny:)Well, when you realized what
it was, why didn't you stop?

23
00:00:57,711 --> 00:01:01,021
(Leonard:)You know me, I'm a
big ol' bookworm.

